<section id="problem">
  <div class="section-label">The Problem</div>
  <h2 class="section-h2">You built a business.<br>But your operations are still<br>running on chaos.</h2>
  <p class="section-body">Most businesses at your stage are duct-taped together &#8212; eight tools, three spreadsheets, and a team of people doing work a system should handle. The bigger you grow, the louder the noise.</p>
  <div class="problem-grid">
    <div class="problem-item fade-up">
      <div class="problem-num">01</div>
      <div class="problem-title">Operational Chaos</div>
